OL,3,GNEWSAWhat does declining birth rate
OL,4,Amean for Isle of Man?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of babies born each year on
OL,7,Fthe Isle of Man has fallen by 45%
OL,8,Fduring the last 15 years, according to
OL,9,Fa demographer who has spent half a
OL,10,Fcentury studying the island's
OL,11,Fpopulation trends.
OL,13,FPaul Craine said births peaked in 2010
OL,14,Fbefore going into a steady decline.
OL,15,FWithin the British Isles, he said the
OL,16,FIsle of Man's numbers really stood out.
OL,18,F"That's clearly a very sharp downturn
OL,19,Fof births," he said. "I haven't seen
OL,20,Fanywhere that's had a sharper fall."
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
