OL,3,GNEWSAWhat does declining birth rate
OL,4,Amean for Isle of Man?
OL,5,
OL,6,FCraine said the falling birth rate was
OL,7,Fexacerbating the issue of a rapidly
OL,8,Fageing population on the island.
